3	// Currency helpers. THE PROJECT'S ROUNDING POLICY LIVES HERE AND ONLY HERE:
4	// every monetary amount is rounded half-up to 2 decimal places via
5	// roundCurrency, and printed via money. Nothing else in the project may
6	// re-implement rounding.
